 as easily be turned on other monsters as mortals and vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I was answering somebody who asked about geists, should have quoted it, my bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-17T15:57:23-07:00","id":1484301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1483900-are-vampires-weak?p=1484050#post1484050\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe instead of turning this into a dogpile form of horseshit, we can meaningfully contribute with additional commentary.<br /> <br /> Or even better, though still very boring, maybe direct it to a thread where it's more relevant to the conversation, or create one for discussing the point.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is a violation of the rules. Leave the thread and take the day off.</span></b><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook